      "detailed_description": "<p>RedLynx Trials 2 Second Edition is a spectacular motorcycle game featuring stunning graphics and addictive gameplay!</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<ul>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>4 game types (race, flip, wheelie, dynamic)<br>Race: Race against other players to compete levels as fast as possible<br>Flip: Try to make as many backflips or frontflips with your bike<br>Wheelie: Drive on your backwheel for longest distance possible<br>Dynamic: Navigate through tracks with various dynamic obstacles and puzzles</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Over 51 tracks to play</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Global highscores</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Ghost challenge. Play against the ghost of any other player in high score list</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Online player profiles with team, country and player statistics</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>25 achievements to unlock</li></ul>",
